==Battleground==
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sairi Nijitani (Enemy)|Sairi Nijitani]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns.
**1 [[Croco]] spawns.
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

